{"id":"boundary_issue_not_action_001","chunk_id":"boundary_issue_not_action_001","title":"遗留问题不得自动转化为待办","content":"能力缺失、机制未建立、方案未敲定或条件不足只能证明存在遗留问题。除非会议明确形成具体动作并存在承诺、指派、接受或确认安排，否则不得根据常识将遗留问题自动改写成待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"critical","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_003","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_003","title":"结论与待办边界","content":"方向性决定、规则性共识和范围取舍属于核心结论；具体执行动作属于待办。同一句规则性共识不得原样复制为待办，除非会议另行形成了具体执行安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_004","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_004","title":"待办与遗留问题边界","content":"有明确动作并存在承诺、指派、接受或会议确认安排的事项属于待办；当前未闭环、无答案、无方案、无条件或无排期的事项属于遗留问题。缺少负责人或截止时间不自动等于遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_005","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_005","title":"遗留问题与风险边界","content":"遗留问题是当前已经存在且尚未解决的卡点；风险是未来可能发生的不利事件及影响。两者可以存在因果关联，但不得混为同一项。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_006","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_006","title":"待办与风险边界","content":"待办描述已经确认需要执行的动作；风险描述未来可能发生的不利事件及影响。应对措施只有在会议明确决定或接受执行时，才可成为待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_008","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_008","title":"建议与结论边界","content":"建议、提议、假设和备选方案只有在会议中出现明确同意、确认、敲定、按此执行或其他等价接受信号后，才能升级为核心结论。沉默、未反对和话题切换不等于共识。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_012","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_012","title":"证据优先规则","content":"所有核心结论、待办、遗留问题和风险必须能够追溯到当前会议原文。RAG 示例只用于理解判断规则，不得迁移为当前会议事实；负责人、时间、结论和风险不确定时保持空值或不输出。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_speaker_owner_001","chunk_id":"boundary_speaker_owner_001","title":"说话人不等于待办负责人","content":"提出、要求或描述任务的人不一定是负责人。负责人必须依据动作指向、明确承诺、接受任务或角色指派判断；无法确定具体人时保留角色级负责人或 null，不得自动把说话人写为 owner。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"critical","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_001","chunk_id":"definition_001","title":"会议议程定义","content":"会议议程描述会议计划或实际采用的讨论主题、推进顺序和沟通框架。只提取依次同步、评估、讨论或确认的主题，不写讨论过程细节、最终决策、执行任务、遗留问题或风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_002","chunk_id":"definition_002","title":"会议总结定义","content":"会议总结是对整场会议背景、核心话题、主要讨论过程、分歧、取舍和整体结果的连贯归纳。必须重新组织表达，不直接拼接原始发言，也不把结论、待办、遗留问题和风险清单重复一遍。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_003","chunk_id":"definition_003","title":"核心结论定义","content":"核心结论是会议中已被明确接受、确认、敲定或形成共识的方向性决定、范围取舍、规则或阶段性安排。建议、假设、单方观点、沉默和无人回应的提议均不能作为核心结论；具体执行动作不属于结论本体。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_004","chunk_id":"definition_004","title":"待办与后续安排定义","content":"待办与后续安排是会议中已经形成明确执行安排的具体动作。至少应存在明确承诺、明确指派、接受任务或会议确认的执行要求之一；单纯的‘需要、建议、最好、可以研究’不足以形成待办。负责人和截止时间可以缺失，但不得凭空补全。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_005","chunk_id":"definition_005","title":"遗留问题定义","content":"遗留问题是会议结束时仍未闭环的当前问题，包括尚无答案、方案、条件、权限、机制或排期的事项。已有明确执行安排时，动作进入待办；只有执行安排之外仍未闭环的部分，才继续保留为遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_006","chunk_id":"definition_006","title":"风险与关注点定义","content":"风险描述未来可能发生的不利事件及其影响，通常包含触发条件、潜在事件或影响结果。当前已经发生的问题优先归入遗留问题；一般背景事实不得作为风险。只有会议明确要求持续监控、复查或关注的事项，才可作为关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_001","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_001","title":"时间：明确日期-1","content":"‘研发周五前完成联调’中，周五前与具体任务直接绑定，可保存原始时间表达；系统具备会议日期和时区时再标准化。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_002","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_002","title":"时间：相对日期-1","content":"‘明天下午提交方案’应保留原始相对时间。只有系统具备会议日期和时区时才能解析为绝对时间；上下文不足时不得猜测。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_003","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_003","title":"时间：会议级日期-1","content":"‘版本8月3日上线’是项目级里程碑，不能自动成为所有任务的 deadline。任务时间必须有任务级绑定证据。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_004","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_004","title":"时间：条件时间-1","content":"‘依赖资料完成后上线’属于条件触发时间，应保留条件表达，不得伪造具体日期。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_005","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_005","title":"时间：无时间-1","content":"任务已经明确但会议未给出时间时，deadline 为 null；缺少时间不影响其待办分类。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_001","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_001","title":"负责人：第一人称承诺-1","content":"‘我来、我负责、我今天补充’等第一人称承诺可将说话人识别为负责人，但必须同时存在明确动作对象。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_002","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_002","title":"负责人：角色指向-1","content":"‘运营侧需要提供素材、由测试跟进’等角色指向可将被指向角色识别为负责人；角色应能与会议参与者或组织角色对应。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_003","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_003","title":"负责人：第二人称指派-1","content":"‘你负责跟供应商确认’表示被指派者承担任务。只有对话参与关系能够明确解析‘你’时才填写具体负责人，否则保留角色级指向或 null。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_004","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_004","title":"负责人：联合责任-1","content":"只有原文明确双方或多个角色分别承担具体动作时，才拆分联合责任。泛泛的‘双方确认、共同推进’不能自动生成多个待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_005","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_005","title":"负责人：无负责人-1","content":"任务表达明确但没有承诺、指派或责任指向时，owner_name 保持 null；不得根据部门职责或说话人身份推测负责人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
